//
// A slot written by a neighboring compute tile's own DMA, not the host --
// test/npu-xrt/tile_sourced_ctrl_pkt_spike/aie.mlir's mechanism, at a real
// (multi-chunk, multi-BD) slot instead of a 2-word proof, built with the
// `aie.iron.overlay` API's `source=` transport. See iron_api_tile_sourced.py
// for why the slot is 0x90 bytes, not hw/one_slot.lit's 0x2000: a source
// tile's 16-entry BD table, one descriptor per control-packet chunk, is this
// transport's real current ceiling (documented v1 scope).
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano
//
// RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
// RUN: %python %S/../iron_api_tile_sourced.py --tag 5 --out %t
//
// RUN: %host_clang %S/../host.cpp -o %t/host.exe -std=c++17 -Wall %xrt_flags %host_link_flags %test_utils_flags
// RUN: %t/host.exe -x %t/aie.xclbin -k MLIR_AIE -i %t/insts.bin --tags 5 --n-elems 4 | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: phase 0: overlay 5 ok
// CHECK: PASS!
